LEDGER='"W-REL PR #11: the mandatory verification gap was closed by the approved verification addendum, with the independently reconstructed policy used in the required reference intervention and rescue replay. The original four setting labels remain unchanged. Exploratory Addendum A2 subsequently attained the frozen reference core conjunction under H0 at (c_R,c_S)=(1/100,3/50), T_SEP=3 and 4. Primary and independent replay statistics agree, and the compared action-table domains and actions agree. Named controls and PM-ACT were outside A2 and were not evaluated. The frozen decision function returned UNRESOLVED-DESIGN for the empty-control invocation; this is not a completed named-control comparison. C-T2 is an exact-Bayes calibration result, and causal findings are restricted to the declared donor interventions and first-order probe battery. Q-LEARN and Q-NECESSITY remain untested. No change is made to the C4 evidence or status row, and no consciousness conclusion is drawn."'
