SEP=("**Systems separation (v1.2/v1.4, per Astra #29).** The maintained-component (AC) lineage (AC1–AC105: closure, repair, succession; F1–F5, U1, U3) and the GRU-8 studies are separate systems. The GRU-8 studies are PRs #8–#10, together with the GRU-8 acquisition and transfer studies in PRs #5 and #7. Their findings do not jointly establish one organism, and no finding from one system is evidence about the other. Astra #29 (verbatim): "+SEPQ)
